		{"id":"f448e7c9464267c4","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/pythorch photos/soft max classfier.png","x":1000,"y":-180,"width":399,"height":188},
		{"id":"c8ce3fad06132861","type":"text","text":"softmax layer","x":-336,"y":320,"width":249,"height":60},
		{"id":"aba391017513159c","type":"text","text":"suppose","x":-47,"y":320,"width":125,"height":60},
		{"id":"314eeb2e2f4447bc","type":"text","text":"$$\nz^l\\in R^K\n$$","x":115,"y":320,"width":145,"height":60},
		{"id":"38183034acd9b564","type":"text","text":"is the output of the last linear layer , the Softmax function:","x":300,"y":320,"width":520,"height":60},
		{"id":"c42c916099384ada","type":"text","text":"$$\nP(y = i) = \\frac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_{j=0}^{K-1} e^{z_j}}\n$$","x":407,"y":440,"width":307,"height":109},
		{"id":"f8e3e1b8aaffc350","type":"text","text":"$$\ni \\in \\{0,1,...,K-1\\}\n$$","x":750,"y":465,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"84ee00f1dc6a1016","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/pythorch photos/softmax 归一化.png","x":361,"y":620,"width":399,"height":149},
		{"id":"bc6231e6f4af48f3","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/pythorch photos/softmax function.png","x":875,"y":601,"width":399,"height":188},
		{"id":"a16833c5d5605bd5","type":"text","text":"Loss function - Cross Entropy","x":-357,"y":880,"width":292,"height":50},
		{"id":"3ab82a8bb86ab20b","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/pythorch photos/cross entropy one hot.png","x":115,"y":806,"width":400,"height":198},
		{"id":"8f44f9a46c0752b4","type":"text","text":"```\nimport torch \ncriterion = torch.nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\nY = torch.LongTensor([2,0,1])\n\nY_pred1 = torch.Tensor([[0.1,0.2,0.9],\n\t\t\t\t\t   [1.1,0.1,0.2],\n\t\t\t\t\t   [0.2,2.1,0.1]])\n\nY_pred2 = torch.Tensor([[0.8,0.2,0.3],\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[0.2,0.3,0.5],\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[0.2,0.2,0.5]])\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\nl1 = criterion(Y_pred1,Y)\nl2 = criterion(Y_pred2,Y)\n\nprint(\"Batch Loss1 = \",l1.data,\"\\nBatch Loss2 = \",l2.data)\n```","x":633,"y":806,"width":567,"height":373},
		{"id":"9f4901d69e19c464","type":"text","text":"There are 10 lables , how to design the neural network","x":-357,"y":1280,"width":292,"height":81},
